{"Using `hash(tuple(...))` to build the cache key makes the key non-deterministic across interpreter processes because Python randomizes the hash seed per process, causing separate web workers/mutators to never share cache entries or be able to invalidate each other's keys - should switch to a deterministic encoding like `\"-\".join(sorted_ids)` or a stable digest": 0.9281716346740723, "Tests create an Organization via `Organization.objects.create` instead of using the factory helper `self.create_organization(...)`, which goes against shared testing conventions and won't inherit future test infrastructure changes": 0.144281268119812}